00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:05,330
20 years later

22
00:02:06,800 --> 00:02:08,760
Esteemed listeners, thank you for your support.

23
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:11,480
Let us pick up where we left off

24
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:15,720
and speak of the legendary emperor of the Heaven's Path Empire,

25
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:18,520
His Majesty Wang Ping.

26
00:02:19,480 --> 00:02:20,680
It is said that

27
00:02:21,080 --> 00:02:22,840
for the past several hundred years

28
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:27,920
the empires of Di Shan, Da Zhou, and Chenyun

29
00:02:28,200 --> 00:02:30,880
held balanced power over the lands.

30
00:02:28,960 --> 00:02:32,130
Heaven's Path Empire

31
00:02:28,960 --> 00:02:32,130
Chenyun Empire

32
00:02:28,960 --> 00:02:32,130
Da Zhou Empire

33
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:34,000
That was until about 20 years ago.

34
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:36,280
The ruler of the Di Shan Empire

35
00:02:36,440 --> 00:02:38,760
raised the taxes and exploited the people,

36
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:41,800
driving the population into misery.

37
00:02:39,640 --> 00:02:42,610
Di Shan Empire

38
00:02:42,920 --> 00:02:44,120
As the saying goes,

39
00:02:44,160 --> 00:02:46,440
heroes rise in turbulent times

40
00:02:46,200 --> 00:02:48,480
and the will of the people is the will of the heavens.

41
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:50,760
We don't know where this Wang Ping

42
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:52,240
was born,

43
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:53,580
nor where he came from.

44
00:02:53,880 --> 00:02:57,040
We just know that during the great famine,

45
00:02:56,800 --> 00:03:00,040
when droughts and floods alternated and people exchanged their children for food,

46
00:03:00,040 --> 00:03:03,880
he arrived in the Di Shan Empire with his wife.

47
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:05,680
This man

48
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:07,240
spoke no empty words.

49
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:09,080
He got things done.

50
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:11,880
For more than 10 years,

51
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,960
he led by example and saved the people

52
00:03:14,200 --> 00:03:15,770
from their distress.

53
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:20,200
News of his righteous acts spread from ten to a hundred people,

54
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:22,520
and his followers grew daily.

55
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:27,640
He gradually gathered a force not to be underestimated.

56
00:03:28,200 --> 00:03:29,720
They built waterways

57
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:31,040
and reclaimed the wasteland.

58
00:03:32,040 --> 00:03:33,840
But his most remarkable feat

59
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:35,960
was leading the people

60
00:03:35,880 --> 00:03:38,640
to repair the dam which caused this whole situation

61
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:40,840
when it was breached many years ago.

62
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:45,440
However, a tall tree catches the wind.

63
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:47,240
His extraordinary acts of kindness

64
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:51,440
became thorns in the tyrant's side.

65
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:53,320
This tyrant

66
00:03:53,600 --> 00:03:55,640
