70
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:05,090
The people's resentment boiled over !

71
00:04:04,320 --> 00:04:05,680
This tyrant was ungrateful !

72
00:04:05,760 --> 00:04:07,280
How unjust it was for Mister Wang...

73
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:08,320
Indeed !

74
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:09,640
Esteemed listeners,

75
00:04:10,040 --> 00:04:12,760
