76
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:15,480
He was not.

77
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:19,320
He had long anticipated that the tyrant would make such a move.

78
00:04:19,840 --> 00:04:22,560
His act of surrender

79
00:04:22,520 --> 00:04:26,680
was in fact a carefully planned move.

80
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:28,120
Where is justice ?

81
00:04:27,880 --> 00:04:29,520
Release Mister Wang !

82
00:04:29,440 --> 00:04:30,880
Yes, release him !

83
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:33,200
The tyrant thought

84
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:36,240
that killing Wang Ping would intimidate the world

85
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,640
and secure his rule.

86
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:39,640
But he didn't know that

87
00:04:40,280 --> 00:04:41,760
his tyranny and injustice

88
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:43,840
lost him the will of the heavens.

89
00:04:44,200 --> 00:04:45,840
He was even less aware

90
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:48,090
that Wang Ping's followers

91
00:04:47,880 --> 00:04:50,840
had already surrounded him.

92
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:57,040
Thus fell the Di Shan Empire, which had stood for a thousand years.

93
00:04:57,400 --> 00:04:59,240
The old king died

94
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:01,560
by the will of the people.

95
00:05:02,040 --> 00:05:03,850
We beg Mister Wang Ping

96
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:05,280
to follow the will of the heavens

97
00:05:05,480 --> 00:05:07,520
and take the throne to save the people.

98
00:05:09,880 --> 00:05:12,880
We beg Mister Wang Ping to take the throne

99
00:05:12,640 --> 00:05:14,680
and save the people.

100
00:05:14,800 --> 00:05:16,000
Thus,

101
00:05:16,080 --> 00:05:19,370
amidst the cheers of the people,

102
00:05:19,200 --> 00:05:21,120
Wang Ping was crowned

103
00:05:20,880 --> 00:05:22,890
and established his rule over the land.

104
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:24,040
He named the country

105
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:25,760
Heaven's Path.

106
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:29,530
He went from spreading benevolence to win the people's hearts

107
00:05:29,400 --> 00:05:32,360
to anticipating the enemy's moves and placing his own hidden pawns.

108
00:05:32,400 --> 00:05:34,640
And then on the execution ground,

109
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:37,760
the people's hearts and his hidden pawns were all triggered together.

110
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:39,520
In this game of chess,

111
00:05:39,280 --> 00:05:41,640
every move was interconnected.

112
00:05:41,720 --> 00:05:42,920
He's truly worthy

113
00:05:42,840 --> 00:05:45,240
of being called a peerless strategist.

114
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:48,640
In the 5 years since Heaven's Path was established,

115
00:05:48,480 --> 00:05:51,360
Wang Ping governed with diligence

116
00:05:51,320 --> 00:05:54,640
