118
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:58,600
The kingdom was happy and the people at peace.

119
00:05:58,360 --> 00:06:03,520
The scenes of widespread suffering never happened again.

120
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:05,520
Excellent !

121
00:06:05,280 --> 00:06:06,770
Well said !

122
00:06:06,520 --> 00:06:07,760
