123
00:06:08,520 --> 00:06:10,520
In just over 20 years,

124
00:06:11,640 --> 00:06:15,440
Ping'er has indeed become the supreme ruler among mortals.

125
00:06:17,440 --> 00:06:19,640
Heaven's Path has the support of the people

126
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:21,040
