162
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:47,810
Ran...

163
00:07:47,600 --> 00:07:48,480
Ran Family ?

164
00:07:48,760 --> 00:07:50,120
The Zhao Family

165
00:07:50,280 --> 00:07:51,840
